# The stem's files this repo carries MODIFIED, each with the reason it differs.
#
# WHAT THIS IS FOR. `.offshoot-omissions` lists what this repo does not carry
# from its stem (template-commit-reveal `with/fuzd-pixi-indexer`); this lists
# what it carries and changes. Everything else in the tree is either the stem's
# byte for byte or this repo's own, so `git diff stem/with/fuzd-pixi-indexer
# main` reads as: the additions (chess), the omissions (listed there) and these.
# A modified file is a conflict on every cascade that touches it, so each one
# here is a cost paid on purpose, and the reason says what it buys.
#
# AND IT IS CHECKED. `web/test/offshoot-divergences.test.ts` fails when a file
# differs from the stem commit last merged and is not listed here, and when a
# listed file no longer differs. `scripts/check-stem-drift.mjs` (run by
# `scripts/apply-omissions.sh` during a merge) is the other half: a modified
# file whose content is the stem's own older version, which a merge resolved
# "ours" leaves behind, is drift rather than a divergence, and does not belong
# here. Written at step I1 of jolly-roger's docs/plans/template-tree-features.md
# (2026-11-17), modelled on stratagems' list and test; the check moves to the
# tree's root at that plan's step V1.
#
# FORMAT. One file per line: its path, then its reason. `#` starts a comment.

# The repo's identity and its documents
README.md                                 the game's README: its rules, how to run it, its Sepolia addresses (the template's is README.template.md)
AGENTS.md                                 chess's own: the game's rules, words, commit-reveal rules and how it takes an update from the stem
CONTEXT.md                                the framework's glossary with this game's section (army, move, spawn point, capture, stone, ...)
.offshoot-omissions                       chess's own omissions: the reference game and what chess replaces it with
web/src/web-config.json                   the brand: Infinite Gambit's name, description and canonical URL
web/static/icon.svg                       the brand: Infinite Gambit's icon
web/static/preview.png                    the brand: Infinite Gambit's social preview
web/src/app.css                           hides the badge Netlify injects over the bottom-right panel

